    evidence:
    - page: page/dmg-vol2-ch7-part5/0015
      quote: "075330 [See Memo DMG 32/10] This section contains guidance on\n\n         1.     entitlement to JSA when a person is outside GB (see DMG 075332)\n\n         2.     the restrictions on entitlement to income based JSA when a person has come\n                from abroad (see DMG 075550)\n\n         3.     the use of insurance paid in another country to satisfy the contribution conditions\n                for entitlement to contribution based JSA (see DMG 075520) and\n\n         4.     who pays UB (see DMG 075530).\n\n\n\n         Meaning of UB"
      locator: DMG 075330
